1
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:49,520
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,400
=Episode 7=

3
00:00:54,399 --> 00:00:56,039
Wait for me.

4
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:00,079
What's wrong, young Taoist?

5
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,840
Why do you look so troubled?

6
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:03,840
We just saved those people.

7
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:04,879
Aren't you happy?

8
00:01:05,280 --> 00:01:07,439
All this liveliness is an illusion.

9
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,560
Until we catch the real demon,

10
00:01:11,159 --> 00:01:13,959
the evil in people's hearts
will keep hurting others.

11
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,000
The demons of this world

12
00:01:15,239 --> 00:01:16,040
can never all be caught.

13
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,719
Only by sealing the sky
with the Divine Stone

14
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:18,959
can we end this once and for all

15
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,680
and save all living beings.

16
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:22,319
This shop is great!

17
00:01:22,599 --> 00:01:23,879
This is so pretty!

18
00:01:24,959 --> 00:01:25,480
It suits me perfectly.

19
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,439
Miss,

20
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,840
that outfit you're wearing is lovely.

21
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:43,680
Where did you buy it?

22
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,760
Right up ahead.

23
00:01:45,959 --> 00:01:46,959
There's a tailor shop

24
00:01:46,959 --> 00:01:47,920
having a sale.

25
00:01:50,599 --> 00:01:51,120
Thanks.

26
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:52,159
Let's go.

27
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:54,519
Let's go take a look.

28
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:55,519
Come help me pick out some clothes.

29
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,000
Clothes?

30
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,040
Come on, let's go!

31
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:05,680
(Artisan Weaving)

32
00:02:05,879 --> 00:02:06,840
This is it.

33
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:10,360
(Artisan Weaving)

34
00:02:10,439 --> 00:02:12,199
Stop staring. Let's go in.

35
00:02:26,319 --> 00:02:27,319
Holy...

36
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:29,800
This place is horrifying.

37
00:02:31,719 --> 00:02:32,520
It's okay.

38
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:33,879
Stay close to me.

39
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:52,080
Are these people alive?

40
00:02:55,479 --> 00:02:55,960
Oh no.

41
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,199
Wait for me!

42
00:03:05,319 --> 00:03:06,360
They're all human.

43
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,199
But they're under a demonic spell.

44
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,000
Living death.

45
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:46,360
My husbands told me

46
00:03:47,639 --> 00:03:49,360
they're all quite envious of you.

47
00:03:55,759 --> 00:03:59,479
I want this young Taoist.

48
00:04:00,879 --> 00:04:02,400
You don't just
snatch someone's dog and walk away.

49
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:04,159
In either realm,

50
00:04:04,199 --> 00:04:05,719
no one takes what's mine.

51
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,960
I'm not a dog. Also...

52
00:04:10,319 --> 00:04:11,400
Get behind me.

53
00:04:13,599 --> 00:04:15,159
Just a plaything.

54
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:17,720
Since you fancy him, my sister,

55
00:04:18,079 --> 00:04:21,519
how about we make a trade?

56
00:04:22,120 --> 00:04:26,240
Or better yet, we can share him.

57
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,600
Split him in two?

58
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:34,839
You pretend to be a loving sister,

59
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:37,720
but you're forcing women
to carry demon kids.

60
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:40,000
A vile, disgusting thing like you

61
00:04:40,279 --> 00:04:41,480
has no right to call me sister.

62
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:47,480
Release all the women you've taken.

63
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:48,720
Remove the demon eggs.

64
00:04:48,959 --> 00:04:50,680
And I'll make your death quick.

65
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,879
You're just a demon

66
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:54,639
blinded by some mortal love.

67
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,759
Don't lecture me.

68
00:05:03,279 --> 00:05:05,079
Showing off your love in front of me?

69
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:10,839
Then I'll carve out
that pure, righteous heart of yours

70
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:13,879
and use it to make my perfect husband.

71
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,839
And these people here

72
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:19,120
will be the offering at our wedding.

73
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,839
How many people have you harmed?

74
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:41,639
Far more than we found in the town.

75
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,240
A demon's evil

76
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:46,079
has no limits.

77
00:05:47,879 --> 00:05:49,040
Though I am a demon,

78
00:05:49,519 --> 00:05:51,199
I am still a woman.

79
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:56,680
All I ever wanted was
someone to love me forever.

80
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:58,120
Was that so wrong?

81
00:05:59,160 --> 00:06:01,680
They hurt me, shamed me,
tried to destroy me.

82
00:06:02,519 --> 00:06:05,120
They even took away my chance
to be a mother.

83
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:08,120
So I had to make a perfect husband

84
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:10,399
of my own.

85
00:06:10,519 --> 00:06:13,120
In this world, only my own children

86
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:16,160
could ever truly love me.

87
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:19,399
I can't have them myself,

88
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:22,519
so I use other women as vessels

89
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:26,040
to forge

90
00:06:27,439 --> 00:06:29,279
a perfect companion

91
00:06:29,759 --> 00:06:31,360
who will never betray me.

92
00:06:32,839 --> 00:06:34,120
She is a Rank-Four great demon,

93
00:06:35,079 --> 00:06:36,079
Wrath-Peak Spider.

94
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,560
You're worse than any demon.

95
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,800
More evil than evil itself.

96
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,319
I've got nothing to say to you

97
00:06:42,319 --> 00:06:43,319
except to end you.

98
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:03,079
You eyesore. Die!

99
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,920
Purging Fire. Burn!

100
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,399
Watch out!

101
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:48,839
Pesky Taoist, you...

102
00:07:48,839 --> 00:07:51,519
I told you to get behind me.

103
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:56,360
What? You are...

104
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:11,319
You two think you can beat me?

105
00:08:11,759 --> 00:08:12,879
Pathetic.

106
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:21,240
(I've been overusing
the Divine Stone's power.)

107
00:08:21,879 --> 00:08:22,879
(My Yin and Yang are out of balance.)

108
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,360
Disgusting!

109
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:34,879
Showing off your love before me?

110
00:08:35,519 --> 00:08:37,240
If you want to die together,

111
00:08:38,519 --> 00:08:39,840
I'll grant your wish.

112
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,480
Pesky Taoist!

113
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,120
Are you okay?

114
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,639
Who told you to risk yourself saving me?

115
00:08:52,039 --> 00:08:55,519
If you die, who's going to
help me find the Divine Stone?

116
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:57,080
Don't flatter yourself.

117
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,840
That little trick won't kill me.

118
00:09:00,039 --> 00:09:00,840
Pesky Taoist!

119
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:04,360
You monster! What did you do to him?

120
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:07,759
The women I used before
had flawed bloodlines.

121
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,000
Their pregnancies always failed.

122
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:14,320
But his pure and righteous heart

123
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:17,879
is the perfect ingredient

124
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,840
for my ideal husband.

125
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,279
Pesky Taoist!

126
00:09:39,039 --> 00:09:39,840
The bite mark.

127
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,480
Why now of all times?

128
00:09:43,279 --> 00:09:44,679
Everything's falling into place.

129
00:09:45,679 --> 00:09:47,240
If I eat you now,

130
00:09:47,879 --> 00:09:49,679
the Stone Curse will be gone for good.

131
00:10:02,919 --> 00:10:04,360
(If I eat you)

132
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,039
(when the bite mark appears,)

133
00:10:06,159 --> 00:10:07,200
(the Stone Curse will be lifted.)

134
00:10:07,559 --> 00:10:09,120
(I'll be free.)

135
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:10,799
(But...)

136
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,600
(Why does it have to be you?)

137
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:43,159
(Let me fan you.)

138
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:44,759
(Let me fan you.)

139
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,399
(I am one with the Divine Stone.)

140
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:05,440
(I couldn't finish him.
I just couldn't.)

141
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:06,919
(Why?)

142
00:11:13,399 --> 00:11:14,360
Young Taoist.

143
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:16,360
Just rest now.

144
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:42,320
I absorbed the demon power
from your spider eggs.

145
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:45,639
And somehow,
it balanced my Yin and Yang.

146
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:47,200
I'm stronger than before.

147
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:49,000
So it really is you.

148
00:11:49,679 --> 00:11:51,519
Is this the Divine Stone's power?

149
00:11:52,399 --> 00:11:53,440
Just one more step,

150
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:55,519
and my husband will be complete.

151
00:11:55,759 --> 00:11:59,799
I said nobody touches what's mine.

152
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,320
I'm not yours.

153
00:12:34,519 --> 00:12:35,320
And what just happened...

154
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:36,919
It's nothing.

155
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:48,720
Where is the spider demon?

156
00:12:48,759 --> 00:12:50,360
The big spider? Is she dead?

157
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:51,879
Spider...

158
00:12:54,159 --> 00:12:55,039
She's not dead.

159
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,480
But her cultivation is shattered.

160
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,279
You can collect her Essence.

161
00:12:58,519 --> 00:13:00,519
That'll boost your Hunter rank.

162
00:13:00,799 --> 00:13:01,360
Mm.

163
00:13:07,159 --> 00:13:08,919
She is the Divine...

164
00:13:14,799 --> 00:13:15,600
You...

165
00:13:18,399 --> 00:13:20,679
Wow, I didn't know I was that famous.

166
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:22,039
Why did you kill her

167
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:23,879
before she could finish?

168
00:13:23,879 --> 00:13:25,120
You stubborn fool.

169
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:26,840
She's a demon.

170
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,200
Can you really trust a demon?

171
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,200
Demons lie.

172
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,399
And looking at her

173
00:13:31,399 --> 00:13:33,240
just reminded me of all her victims.

174
00:13:33,240 --> 00:13:34,279
Killing her felt like justice.

175
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,600
I just dreamed about you.

176
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:38,960
You turned into a man.

177
00:13:39,639 --> 00:13:41,480
Now that's some serious Yin and Yang.

178
00:13:41,679 --> 00:13:43,320
You must be a master of balance!

179
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:47,399
But it felt so real.

180
00:13:49,519 --> 00:13:52,320
Yuanchu,
you were in the same cocoon with her.

181
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:53,320
Did you see it?

182
00:13:55,279 --> 00:13:55,679
I...

183
00:13:55,679 --> 00:13:58,159
They say the Divine Stone
can bridge Yin and Yang.

184
00:13:58,799 --> 00:13:59,639
Miss Ziyan,

185
00:14:00,679 --> 00:14:03,600
have you felt the Stone's presence?

186
00:14:04,919 --> 00:14:06,440
She's obviously a demoness.

187
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,679
How could she be a man?

188
00:14:07,879 --> 00:14:08,519
You two

189
00:14:08,519 --> 00:14:10,679
must have been confused
by the demon's magic.

190
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:12,679
You're mixing up our faces.

191
00:14:14,399 --> 00:14:15,559
That's right!

192
00:14:16,039 --> 00:14:18,559
Really? I've heard that when people
spend enough time together,

193
00:14:18,559 --> 00:14:20,559
they start to look alike.

194
00:14:21,320 --> 00:14:23,759
You two really look like
a married couple now.

195
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,879
I was just dazed by the demon.

196
00:14:26,279 --> 00:14:27,639
It must have been a dream.

197
00:14:28,879 --> 00:14:29,679
Alright.

198
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:32,200
Let's get these poor people out of here.

199
00:14:34,519 --> 00:14:36,320
Then we celebrate with a feast!

200
00:14:37,360 --> 00:14:38,399
All you think about is food.

201
00:14:41,759 --> 00:14:42,559
Let's go.

202
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:02,800
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

203
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:06,200
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

204
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:09,720
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

205
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:13,040
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

206
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:19,960
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

207
00:15:20,560 --> 00:15:27,555
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

208
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:31,800
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

209
00:15:31,800 --> 00:15:35,640
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

210
00:15:35,640 --> 00:15:42,440
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
